 explic\'f3 c\'f3mo deb\'eda interpretarse la }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\fs20\lang9226\langfe2052\langnp9226\insrsid1524153 subregla }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs20\lang9226\langfe2052\langnp9226\insrsid1524153 
